# Build outputs — regenerated by `python run.py`, never committed.
# Keeping them out is what stops the repo growing by ~200KB every night.
#
# The whole of data/ is ignored, not just the subfolders. data/transmission.json
# is the archived session's SYNTHETIC output — simulated price paths. It is
# clearly labelled as such, but a repo whose entire argument is data honesty
# must not ship fabricated series that someone could mistake for results.
data/
site/data.js
phase0_audit_results.json

